<body>
<div type="letter">
<pb facs="1078678" n="1"/>
  <opener><salute rend="center">Viro Clarissimo atque Incomparabili
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-118509969" type="person">Johanni Bernoulli</rs>
      <lb/><abbr>S. P. D.</abbr>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-102552517" type="person">Petrus Antonius Michelotti</rs></salute></opener>
  <p>Quoniam hac hebdomada responsum, uti sperabam,
      <lb/>ad meas <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> ultima pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>teriti Augusti <rs key="B_991170515019805501" type="letter">datas</rs> non accepi,
      <lb/>non abs re fore iudico unam adhuc ad te mittere epis<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tolam adhoc ut si forte fortuna prim<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> litter<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>
      <lb/>ad tuas non pervenerint manus, saltem h<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>c, quam etiam
      <lb/>per <rs key="place_VER-tirola" type="place">Tyrolim</rs> amandare decerno, perveniat.</p>
  <p><choice><abbr>Illustriss.<hi rend="sup">i</hi></abbr><expan>Illustrissimi</expan></choice> et <choice><abbr>Excell:<hi rend="sup">mi</hi></abbr><expan>Excellentissimi</expan></choice> D. D. Patavini Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatores</rs>
      <lb/>responsum a Te Vir Doctissime expectant, cupiuntque
      <lb/>scire num sis derelicturus Patriam <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavinam</rs>
      <lb/>Provinciam amplexurus salario annuo 1500 Thalerorum
      <lb/>imperialium Tibi persoluto. Ego revera ipsis <choice><abbr>Nobiliss.<hi rend="sup">mis</hi></abbr><expan>Nobilissimis</expan></choice>
      <lb/><rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatoribus</rs> spem aliquam Tui obtinendi feci si
      <lb/>annuatim persolvere velint 1500 Thaleros imperiales
      <lb/>hoc est totidem uncias argenti; hancque spem deduxi
      <lb/>ex <rs key="B_991170515020205501" type="letter">humanissima tua epistola</rs> 18 Julii exarata, in qua
      <lb/>scripsisti Vir Celeberrime Te ne quidem permotum
      <lb/>iri oblat<choice><orig><g ref="#ahat">â</g></orig><reg>a</reg></choice> summa minori quam 1500 Thalerorum impe<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>rialium hoc est totidem unciarum argenti. Salarium
      <lb/>1500 Thalerorum imperialium quod petivisti Tibi exhi<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bent, atque persolvent annuatim Amplissimi Patavini
      <lb/>Archilyc<choice><orig><g ref="#ehat">ê</g></orig><reg>e</reg></choice>i <rs key="pers_DE-588-1089924410 pers_DE-588-1111043582 pers_DE-588-1178371670" type="person">Moderatores</rs>: quare reliquum est ut Tu Vir
      <lb/>Clarissime sine mora <rs key="B_991170515019305501" type="letter">litteris tuis</rs><note type="editorial" resp="SG">Johann I Bernoulli beharrt in seiner <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019305501">Antwort vom 20. Oktober 1714</rs> auf 1’500 Talern im Wert von ebenso vielen Unzen Silber. Diese Wertbestimmung hatte er bereits am <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515020205501">18. Juli 1714</rs> ausdrücklich genannt. Michelotti räumt am <rs type="letter" key="B_991170515019205501">9. November 1714</rs> ein, dass die Verhandlungen über diesen Betrag zunächst zwischen ihm und Bernoulli geführt worden seien. Die <hi rend="i">Riformatori</hi> hätten dagegen 1’500 venezianische Dukaten für eine sechsjährige Lehrtätigkeit angeboten. Der Streit betraf somit die Bewertung der Geldsorten und die Verbindlichkeit der vermittelten Zusagen, nicht eine erst nachträglich von Bernoulli geänderte Forderung.</note> iucundissimis me
      <lb/>admonitum facias de tuo adventu, quem cum Proce<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc>
<pb facs="1078679" n="2"/>
      <lb break="no"/>ribus<note type="editorial" resp="SG">Ob Michelotti mit «Proceribus meis» die zuvor genannten Riformatori oder weitere vornehme Venezianer aus seinem Umfeld meint, bleibt offen.</note> meis multisque Viris doctis ipse exopto. Uti dice<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>bam in <rs key="B_991170515019805501" type="letter">pr<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>cedentibus meis</rs> progressu temporis poteris
      <lb/>substituere Agnatum Tuum Doctissimum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>
      <lb/>si <rs key="place_GEO-3171728" type="place">Patavina Urbs</rs> non arridebit: c<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice>ter<choice><orig><g ref="#ugrav">ù</g></orig><reg>u</reg></choice>m aer pata<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>vinus optimus est, et temperamento tuo conducet;
      <lb/><rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Veneti<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice></rs> fortasse non displicebunt vacationum tempo<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>re, quo cubiculum Domi me<choice><orig><g ref="#ae">æ</g></orig><reg>ae</reg></choice> sine expensis tibi sem<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>per paratum erit. Stipendium oblatum 1500 Tha<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>lerorum imperialium ne respuas rogo, et vocatio<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>nibus tam honorificis ne relucteris deprecor saltem
      <lb/>ne labores mei pro Vobis libentissime impensi eva<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>dant prorsus irriti et frustranei.</p> <closer><salute>Vale et fave
      <lb/>Vir omni virtutum genere ornatissime.</salute>
<dateline>Dabam <rs key="place_GEO-3164603" type="place">Venetiis</rs> <choice><abbr>a. d.</abbr><expan>ad diem</expan></choice> <date when="1714-09-22">22<choice><orig><g ref="#ndot">.</g></orig><reg/></choice> Septembris 1714</date></dateline></closer>
  <postscript><p><abbr>P. S.</abbr> Salutatos cupio ex me Illustrissimum <rs key="pers_DE-588-135542286" type="person">
         Fratrem</rs>
        <lb/>Tuum Status Consiliarium et Clarissimum Agna<pc type="hyphenation">-</pc><lb break="no"/>tum <rs key="pers_DE-588-119166895" type="person">Nicolaum</rs>; quorum primus meam spero
        <lb/>accipiet <rs key="B_991170517053105501" type="letter">epistolam</rs> ei adjunctam quam ad Te
        <lb/>amandavi <choice><abbr>d.</abbr><expan>die</expan></choice> ultima transacti Augusti.</p></postscript>
<pb facs="1078680" n="3" type="empty"/>
<pb facs="1078681" n="4" type="empty"/>
</div></body></text></TEI>
